ion_1_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_srt_MortgageLoansOnRealEstateDescriptionTypeOfPropertyAxis_xrn_InpatientRehabFacilitiesMember_deU7jXNCW0SmvBGPkqry7A" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="xrn:NumberOfPropertiesSold" scale="0" id="Narr_0RGBdiiziEOTBhUFjXGQPA">seven</ix:nonFraction> IRFs which were sold into the IRF Joint Venture.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt;">On June 1, 2026, the Company completed the acquisition of The Landing Alexandria (the &#8220;Landing&#8221;), a <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_item_aNkQejntjkKlFd_5_7mNlQ" contextRef="As_Of_6_1_2026_srt_MortgageLoansOnRealEstateDescriptionTypeOfPropertyAxis_xrn_SeniorHousingFacilitiesMember_srt_RealEstateAndAccumulatedDepreciationDescriptionOfPropertyAxis_xrn_LandingAlexandriaMember_UnTq7ZtzoE6VuUb_E2A1gA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xrn:NumberOfUnitsIncludedInProperty" scale="0" id="Narr_mgyOeKayW0yP0PtJAFaerg">163</ix:nonFraction>-home, luxury seniors housing community located in Alexandria, Virginia, from affiliates of Silverstone Senior Living (&#8220;SSL&#8221;) for a purchase price of approximately $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_W8XzfZqNBU-lEpTZLQUYuA" contextRef="Duration_6_1_2026_To_6_1_2026_srt_MortgageLoansOnRealEstateDescriptionTypeOfPropertyAxis_xrn_SeniorHousingFacilitiesMember_srt_RealEstateAndAccumulatedDepreciationDescriptionOfPropertyAxis_xrn_LandingAlexandriaMember_H_olO3fCP06BAlUX-AjksQ" decimals="-6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:AssetAcquisitionConsiderationTransferred" scale="6" id="Narr_padPVkXXQECRTFEKNvJYgg">130</ix:nonFraction> million. <span style="background:#ffffff;">The Landing offers independent living, assisted living and memory care. </span>For this acquisition, substantially all of the fair value was concentrated in a single identifiable asset or group of similar identifiable assets and, therefore, this acquisition represented an asset acquisition. Accordingly, $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_W8XzfZqNBU-lEpTZLQUYuA" contextRef="As_Of_6_1_2026_srt_MortgageLoansOnRealEstateDescriptionTypeOfPropertyAxis_xrn_SeniorHousingFacilitiesMember_srt_RealEstateAndAccumulatedDepreciationDescriptionOfPropertyAxis_xrn_LandingAlexandriaMember_UnTq7ZtzoE6VuUb_E2A1gA" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xrn:AssetAcquisitionTransactionCostsCapitalized" scale="6" id="Narr_8oQJehEoAEKl-xpwmbsHwA">1.0</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million of transaction costs for this acquisition were capitalized.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt;">On June 1, 2026, the Company completed the acquisition of The Riviera at Alexandria (the &#8220;Riviera&#8221;), a <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_item_aNkQejntjkKlFd_5_7mNlQ" contextRef="As_Of_6_1_2026_srt_MortgageLoansOnRealEstateDescriptionTypeOfPropertyAxis_xrn_SeniorHousingFacilitiesMember_srt_RealEstateAndAccumulatedDepreciationDescriptionOfPropertyAxis_xrn_RivieraAlexandriaMember_Q_BzB1mFukmhnYAv63LyJQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xrn:NumberOfUnitsIncludedInProperty" scale="0" id="Narr_Bpz50v3iN0aAi9Rlm0CtiQ">129</ix:nonFraction>-home, luxury seniors housing community located in Alexandria, Virginia, from affiliates of SSL for a purchase price of approximately $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_W8XzfZqNBU-lEpTZLQUYuA" contextRef="Duration_6_1_2026_To_6_1_2026_srt_MortgageLoansOnRealEstateDescriptionTypeOfPropertyAxis_xrn_SeniorHousingFacilitiesMember_srt_RealEstateAndAccumulatedDepreciationDescriptionOfPropertyAxis_xrn_RivieraAlexandriaMember_7jTOHUrH90qTICFfwR5zzw" decimals="-6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:AssetAcquisitionConsiderationTransferred" scale="6" id="Narr_9mHE8tiJp0u3LZOdWvZ8Mw">119</ix:nonFraction> million. The Riviera offers independent living. For this acquisition, substantially all of the fair value was concentrated in a single identifiable asset or group of similar identifiable assets and, therefore, this acquisition represented an asset acquisition. Accordingly, $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_W8XzfZqNBU-lEpTZLQUYuA" contextRef="As_Of_6_1_2026_srt_MortgageLoansOnRealEstateDescriptionTypeOfPropertyAxis_xrn_SeniorHousingFacilitiesMember_srt_RealEstateAndAccumulatedDepreciationDescriptionOfPropertyAxis_xrn_RivieraAlexandriaMember_Q_BzB1mFukmhnYAv63LyJQ" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xrn:AssetAcquisitionTransactionCostsCapitalized" scale="6" id="Narr_zJGrSCJ9z06g97mMy4IwJg">0.9</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million of transaction costs for this acquisition were capitalized.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt;">The Company operates the Landing and the Riviera as SHOP communities and one of its TRSs has engaged an affiliate of Greystone Communities to manage the day-to-day operations of the communities. Under this structure, the Company owns the real estate and participates directly in the operating results of the communities, including revenues and operating expenses, rather than receiving fixed lease payments from a third-party tenant.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justi