th</span></span> extension options available at the Company&#8217;s election (the &#8220;Revolver&#8221;). The Credit Facility also includes a $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_W8XzfZqNBU-lEpTZLQUYuA" contextRef="Duration_10_8_2025_To_10_8_2025_qfEkG0IguUawnJ8P-4ShQw" decimals="-6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xrn:LineOfCreditFacilityContingentIncreaseAdditionalBorrowingCapacity" scale="6" id="Narr_2xM-zjS-P0i8MPQEeCSLgg">500</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million accordion feature. Interest rates on amounts outstanding under the Credit Facility equal the term&#160;SOFR&#160;plus a borrowing spread based on the current pricing grid in the Credit Facility.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;">The Operating Partnership is subject to a number of financial covenants under the Credit Facility, including, among other things, the following as of the end of each fiscal quarter, (i)&#160;a maximum consolidated unsecured leverage ratio of less than <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_ef-_kVzx4E6rVyPSxykuTQ" contextRef="As_Of_10_8_2025_srt_StatementScenarioAxis_xrn_ScenarioDebtCovenantTermsMember_shCgEo2DI0ChmrJ9SsMbPQ" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xrn:MaximumConsolidatedUnsecuredLeverageRatioUnderFinancialCovenants" scale="-2" id="Narr_rjhS_XYcdkOsw1sfkUS_9Q">60</ix:nonFraction>%, (ii)&#160;a maximum consolidated secured leverage ratio of less than <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_ef-_kVzx4E6rVyPSxykuTQ" contextRef="As_Of_10_8_2025_srt_StatementScenarioAxis_xrn_ScenarioDebtCovenantTermsMember_shCgEo2DI0ChmrJ9SsMbPQ" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xrn:MaximumConsolidatedSecuredLeverageRatioUnderFinancialCovenants" scale="-2" id="Narr_HzFM8cwe3