:justify;">Two&#160;months of this amount, equal to $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_W8XzfZqNBU-lEpTZLQUYuA" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2026_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_xrn_SeriesBCumulativeRedeemablePreferredStockMember_hCwS5iBkFUCJeoRGhDTooA" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xrn:DividendAccrued" scale="3" id="Narr_cmx9TnVMK0Gx3u8NQP2u3Q">680</ix:nonFraction>, was accrued at June 30, 2026.</p></td></tr></table></ix:nonNumeric><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The holders of the Series B Preferred Stock are entitled to receive dividend payments only when, as and if declared by the Board (or a duly authorized committee of the Board). The Series B Preferred Stock dividends will accrue or be payable in cash from the original issue date, on a cumulative basis, quarterly in arrears on each dividend payment date at a fixed rate per annum equal to&#160;<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_ef-_kVzx4E6rVyPSxykuTQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2026_To_3_31_2026_us-gaap_DividendsAxis_xrn_O2026Q1DividendsMember_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_xrn_SeriesBCumulativeRedeemablePreferredStockMember_VFSRHC0YvUa8ZY_ZVP0v7w" decimals="4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:PreferredStockDividendRatePercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_XPaNjky3Q0mb81Lpn6sOJQ">8.00</ix:nonFraction>% of the liquidation preference of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_CaGrIE2Rg0mTRWv-HayoJA" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2026_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_xrn_SeriesBCumulativeRedeemablePreferredStockMember_hCwS5iBkFUCJeoRGhDTooA" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:PreferredStockLiquidationPreference" scale="0" id="Narr_56svZ82KTU6GxUzBqvr_Sg">25.00</ix:nonFraction>&#160;per share (equivalent to $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_CaGrIE2Rg0mTRWv-HayoJA" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_us-gaap_DividendsAxis_xrn_O2026AdividendsMember_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_xrn_SeriesBCumulativeRedeemablePreferredStockMember_rmhOsAkiWE-W-JA8w_z9LQ" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:PreferredStockDividendsPerShareDeclared" scale="0" id="Narr_7xYjj488h0-IIjoJua9KcA">2.00</ix:nonFraction>&#160;per share on an annual basis). Dividends on the Series&#160;B Preferred Stock are cumulative and accrue whether or not (i)&#160;funds are legally available for the payment of those dividends, (ii)&#160;the Company has earnings or (iii)&#160;those dividends are declared by the Board. The Series B Preferred Stock may be partially or fully redeemed by the Company beginning in November 2030. The quarterly dividend payment dates on the Series B Preferred Stock are January&#160;31, April&#160;30, July&#160;31 and October&#160;31 of each year. During the six-month period ended June 30, 2026 the Company paid preferred dividends on its Series B Preferred Stock of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_W8XzfZqNBU-lEpTZLQUYuA" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_xrn_SeriesBCumulativeRedeemablePreferredStockMember_F-FZtUcRyEO_jnw0mv6ppg" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:PaymentsOfDividendsPreferredStockAndPreferenceStock" scale="3" id="Narr_GYkvCPYSNkOg-utJU9NIMg">1,820</ix:nonFraction>. There were <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_HJR3iplgnESSPBxpNr-wkA" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2025_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_xrn_SeriesBCumulativeRedeemablePreferredStockMember_z_-mtITQ-kS1IMRpS94h2g" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="us-gaap:PreferredStockSharesOutstanding" scale="0" id="Narr_zN3nvu5Jk0WUQcBDOyPAww"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_HJR3iplgnESSPBxpNr-wkA" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2025_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_xrn_SeriesBCumulativeRedeemablePreferredStockMember_z_-mtITQ-kS1IMRpS94h2g" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="us-gaap:PreferredStockSharesIssued" scale="0" id="Narr_o3b3cBprm0GAhDrjqxLCHg">no</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction> Series B Preferred Stock shares issued and outstanding during the six-month period ended June 30, 2025.</p></ix:continuation></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">-20-</p></div></div>
<div style="background-color:#000000;clear:both;height:2pt;page-break-after:always;width:88.24%;border:0;margin:30pt 5.88% 30pt 5.88%;"></div><div style="max-width:100%;padding-left:5.88%;padding-right:5.88%;position:relative;"><div style="margin-top:21.6pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 30pt 0pt;"><a href="#TOC"><span style="font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Table of Contents</span></a></p></div><div style="clear:both;max-width:100%;position:relative;min-height:11.5pt;"><a id="_a0b9bed0_a9fd_4454_ae46_81ac88a0e54d"></a><a id="Tc_7jMZ0n5iDUOomqFZtdyyHQ_1_6"></a><a id="Tc_mTZLT3f4UUW-zexragihOQ_1_9"></a><a id="Tc_4g49jfEERUWR0wru2-clCA_2_0"></a><a id="Tc_Evf6isYkQkSrVWVlRxBRkw_2_2"></a><a id="Tc_6t9h1fR4bEimS4FvbsxaxQ_2_4"></a><a id="Tc_ens69hFhXk6eyc8YJWG7NQ_2_6"></a><a id="Tc_tvlKCWE5aUCxdjxmKZ6-iA_2_9"></a><a id="Tc_NyPMePQ7FUKoR8FxzypohA_4_0"></a><a id="Tc_yi5nn-r3OUO6w6FKblQYjQ_4_6"></a><a id="Tc_2Jtov0LenUCSPm8qkrBAIg_4_9"></a><ix:continuation id="Tb_ySXibvJgm0e1LpxfZUidkg_cont2" continuedAt="Tb_ySXibvJgm0e1LpxfZUidkg_cont3"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><i style="font-style:italic;text-decoration-color:#000000;text-decoration-line:underline;text-decoration-style:solid;">Series&#160;C Convertible Preferred Stock</i></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On May 29, 2026 and June 2, 2026, the Company issued an aggregate of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_HJR3iplgnESSPBxpNr-wkA" contextRef="Duration_5_29_2026_To_6_2_2026_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_xrn_SeriesCCumulativeRedeemablePreferredStockMember_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_us-gaap_PrivatePlacementMember_FFGjb4AuZE2eLdDAk-SOsg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:SaleOfStockNumberOfSharesIssuedInTransaction" scale="0" id="Narr_PeH2RYOJWkOl5j0kLPCqrQ">1,000,000</ix:nonFraction> shares of its Series C Convertible Preferred Stock, for aggregate gross proceeds of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_W8XzfZqNBU-lEpTZLQUYuA" contextRef="Duration_5_29_2026_To_6_2_2026_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_xrn_SeriesCCumulativeRedeemablePreferredStockMember_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_us-gaap_PrivatePlacementMember_FFGjb4AuZE2eLdDAk-SOsg" decimals="-6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:SaleOfStockConsiderationReceivedPerTransaction" scale="6" id="Narr_h-s1jP2IwEivmCoICZeHcA">100.0</ix:nonFraction> million. The Series C Convertible Preferred Stock provides for cumulative dividends at a rate of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_ef-_kVzx4E6rVyPSxykuTQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_xrn_SeriesCCumulativeRedeemablePreferredStockMember_6nFzQtEezEa7vqokx3-mUA" decimals="4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xrn:PreferredStockDividendRateYearsOneThroughThreePercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_SsUg6CFYkEOMbyPEjRicJQ">6.00</ix:nonFraction>% per annum, which increases to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_ef-_kVzx4E6rVyPSxykuTQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_xrn_SeriesCCumulativeRedeemablePreferredStockMember_6nFzQtEezEa7vqokx3-mUA" decimals="4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xrn:PreferredStockDividendRateYearFourPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_0NdlRsk06USFbT1k-r0Xew">8.00</ix:nonFraction>% on June 2, 2030 (the date that is four years after the date of last issuance) to the extent the Series C Convertible Preferred Stock is not redeemed or converted and increases by an additional <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_ef-_kVzx4E6rVyPSxykuTQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_xrn_SeriesCCumulativeRedeemablePreferredStockMember_6nFzQtEezEa7vqokx3-mUA" decimals="4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xrn:PreferredStockDividendRateAnnualIncreaseAfterYearFourPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_VML_fi9uBU6WbcZTFa3QbA">2.00</ix:nonFraction>% on each subsequent anniversary thereafter, up to a maximum of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_ef-_kVzx4E6rVyPSxykuTQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_xrn_SeriesCCumulativeRedeemablePreferredStockMember_6nFzQtEezEa7vqokx3-mUA" decimals="4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xrn:PreferredStockMaximumDividendRate" scale="-2" id="Narr__mqHQGUgX0ile7Otc4cQHA">12.00</ix:nonFraction>%, to the extent the Series C Convertible Preferred Stock is not redeemed or converted as of such anniversary dates. The Series C Convertible Preferred Stock is convertible into shares of the Company&#8217;s common stock at an initial conversion rate of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_ef-_kVzx4E6rVyPSxykuTQ" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2026_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_xrn_SeriesCCumulativeRedeemablePreferredStockMember_Pkq9suXbZkC70LTc4X7g8Q" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:PreferredStockConvertibleConversionRatio" scale="0" id="Narr_eyGOFL1rpkuR0Luy5puPYQ">2.32558</ix:nonFraction> shares of common stock per share of Series C Convertible Preferred Stock, which is based on an implied conversion price of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_CaGrIE2Rg0mTRWv-HayoJA" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2026_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_xrn_SeriesCCumulativeRedeemablePreferredStockMember_Pkq9suXbZkC70LTc4X7g8Q" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:PreferredStockConvertibleConversionPrice" scale="0" id="Narr_C49dJ5mKp0eXqjjJlCCkpw">43.00</ix:nonFraction> per share of common stock, subject to certain anti-dilution adjustments. The Company may redeem the Series C Convertible Preferred Stock, in whole or in part, at its option on or after June 2, 2030 (the date that is four years after the date of last issuance), at a cash redemption price equal to the liquidation preference of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_CaGrIE2Rg0mTRWv-HayoJA" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2026_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_xrn_SeriesCCumulativeRedeemablePreferredStockMember_Pkq9suXbZkC70LTc4X7g8Q" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:PreferredStockLiquidationPreference" scale="0" id="Narr_0ZKv8bSsG0ixQhJqYCf6ag">100</ix:nonFraction> per share, plus accumulated and unpaid regular dividends, including any defaulted regular dividends. The Series C Convertible Preferred Stock generally has no voting rights, except for limited voting rights with respect to certain matters affecting its rights and preferences. In addition, upon issuance of the Series C Convertible Preferred Stock, the Company&#8217;s ability to make distributions with respect to, or redeem, purchase or acquire, or make liquidation payments on, any other shares of capital stock ranking junior to or on a parity with the Series C Convertible Preferred Stock became subject to certain restrictions in the event that the Company does not declare distributions on the Series C Convertible Preferred Stock during any distribution period. </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The Company assessed the characteristics of the Series C Convertible Preferred Stock in accordance with the provisions of ASC Topic 480 &#8211; &#8220;Distinguishing Liabilities from Equity,&#8221; and concluded that the Series C Convertible Preferred Stock is classified as permanent equity.</p><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_xrn_SeriesCCumulativeRedeemablePreferredStockMember_us-gaap_StatementEquityComponentsAxis_us-gaap_PreferredStockMember_0HeDPhr3h0WQSTCPGeTNLg" name="us-gaap:ScheduleOfDividendsPayableTextBlock" id="Tb_o8_sPODlJUi8hbfrsUYoPQ" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-