-gaap:PaymentsOfDividendsCommonStock" scale="3" id="Narr_n1vIInrjAEu752Z0zfM7gQ">30,503</ix:nonFraction>, respectively.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">As of June 30, 2026 and December&#160;31, 2025, the Company had accrued dividend balances of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_W8XzfZqNBU-lEpTZLQUYuA" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2026_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_CommonStockMember_HniG5euXXE-5S2E1a5QWyA" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xrn:DividendAccrued" scale="3" id="Narr_eMpgiBnf_ECLV7q_h0vbSw">300</ix:nonFraction> and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_W8XzfZqNBU-lEpTZLQUYuA" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_CommonStockMember_3PR43ujRfUi10N5zE06AyA" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xrn:DividendAccrued" scale="3" id="Narr_NesMQXpRVUaNpxiVcUWVpQ">216</ix:nonFraction> for dividends payable on the aggregate annual and long-term LTIP Units that are subject to retroactive receipt of dividends on the amount of LTIP Units ultimately earned. During the six months ended June 30, 2026, $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_W8XzfZqNBU-lEpTZLQUYuA" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2026_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_xrn_AnnualAndLongTermIncentivePlanUnitsMember_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_CommonStockMember_OSVlkRGaTUG6hVDFMmI93A" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xrn:DividendAccrued" scale="3" id="Narr__EW2O2y9dk2PnSO3QpmQLA">184</ix:nonFraction> dividends were accrued and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_W8XzfZqNBU-lEpTZLQUYuA" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_xrn_AnnualAndLongTermIncentivePlanUnitsMember_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_CommonStockMember_SAV7_pG9Ukea1ktOP94FpA" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:PaymentsOfDividendsCommonStock" scale="3" id="Narr_CYHH4apL7USzsTPWaHEBmw">10